From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: qcom,lpass-va-macro: add SM8350

The SM8350 VA macro is programmed like the SM8250 one, with the same
clocks from the ADSP, so describe it with the SM8250 compatible as
fallback.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,lpass-va-macro.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,lpass-va-macro.yaml
@@ -28,6 +28,9 @@
               - qcom,sm8750-lpass-va-macro
               - qcom,x1e80100-lpass-va-macro
           - const: qcom,sm8550-lpass-va-macro
+      - items:
+          - const: qcom,sm8350-lpass-va-macro
+          - const: qcom,sm8250-lpass-va-macro
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
